  "content": "\n\n<p>這是一個可選的擴充套件，適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cobblemon-interface\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon Interface</a> 材質包，會將生命值與經驗條的顏色調整為與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a> 中寶可夢 HP 和經驗值的配色相匹配。</p>\n<h2>對比</h2>\n<p>修改前 -&gt; 修改後</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/R6DWLPUQ/images/13d519c1800e148aba30884cca336a74b13fb705.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>配色對照</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/R6DWLPUQ/images/fadbc54d84c027b8b2126191ec9b894bae1793f0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f934267676354834442%252f1091579923396820992\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.1.0/assets/compact/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> 前往 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 Cobblemon Discord 伺服器</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcobblemon-interface-recolored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fM4M5K4BDR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>",
